"""
Comprehensive Trading System
=============================
This module implements a self-contained trading system that:
  1. Receives and validates market data
  2. Calculates technical indicators
  3. Generates buy/sell/hold signals
  4. Manages risk (position sizing, stop loss, max exposure)
  5. Executes orders (simulated broker interface)
  6. Handles partial fills and order lifecycle
  7. Reconciles positions against broker state
  8. Produces compliance reports
