"""
Comprehensive Supply Chain Optimization Module

Implements:
- Demand forecasting
- Inventory optimization (EOQ, safety stock, reorder points)
- Production scheduling
- Logistics coordination and routing
- Supplier relationship management and scoring
- Shipment tracking
- Performance dashboard generation
